---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Delegate's Corner
permalink: /delegates-corner/
---
<h1>Delegate's Corner</h1>
<p class="lede">Each month our Delegate writes to the groups of Area 56 about what's happening in general service.</p>
<ul class="dc-list">
  {%- for dc in collections.delegatesCorner %}
  <li>
    <a href="{{ dc.url }}">
      <span class="dc-month">{{ dc.date | monthYear }}</span>
      <span class="dc-title">{{ dc.data.title }}</span>
    </a>
    {% if dc.data.pdf %}<a class="dc-pdf" href="{{ dc.data.pdf }}">PDF</a>{% endif %}
  </li>
  {%- endfor %}
</ul>
